u, pengalihan dinamis, analitik, alur kerja tim. Rangkaian fitur lengkap, tanpa basa-basi.</p></section>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d57fb629 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d57fb629\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ff8ef68 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"3ff8ef68\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<style>.d01-fpage{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 32px 32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:64px;}.d01-fgroup{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2.4fr;gap:48px;align-items:start;border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);padding-top:32px;}.d01-fgroup-head{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;position:sticky;top:120px;}.d01-fgroup-id{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fgroup-id b{color:#0F8A5F;font-weight:500;}.d01-fgroup-name{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0A0E15;margin:0;}.d01-fgroup-name em{font-family:\"Newsreader\",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fgroup-blurb{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#5B6470;margin:8px 0 0;max-width:32ch;}.d01-fcards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);}.d01-fcard{padding:28px 24px;border-right:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);background:#FAF7EC;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:240px;}.d01-fcard:nth-child(3n){border-right:0;}.d01-fcard:nth-child(n+4){border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);}.d01-fcard-id{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fcard-title{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0A0E15;margin:0;}.d01-fcard-desc{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#5B6470;margin:0;}.d01-fcard-tag{align-self:flex-start;font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;border:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);padding:4px 8px;margin-top:auto;}@media(max-width:1100px){.d01-fgroup{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;}.d01-fgroup-head{position:static;}}@media(max-width:900px){.d01-fcards{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.d01-fcard{border-right:0 !important;border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);min-height:auto;}.d01-fcard:first-child{border-top:0;}.d01-fpage{padding:32px 20px;gap:40px;}}@media(max-width:1100px) and (min-width:901px){.d01-fcards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}.d01-fcard{border-right:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13) !important;border-top:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);}.d01-fcard:first-child,.d01-fcard:nth-child(2){border-top:0;}.d01-fcard:nth-child(2n){border-right:0 !important;}}.d01-fcta{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 32px 80px;}.d01-fcta-inner{border:1px solid rgba(10,14,21,0.13);background:#FAF7EC;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:48px;padding:48px;align-items:center;}.d01-fcta-kicker{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5B6470;margin-bottom:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}.d01-fcta-kicker::before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#0F8A5F;}.d01-fcta-headline{font-family:\"Geist\",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0A0E15;margin:0;}.d01-fcta-headline em{font-family:\"Newsreader\",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#5B6470;}.d01-fcta-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}.d01-fcta-actions a{font-family:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:14px 24px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #0A0E15;transition:background .15s,color .15s,border-color .15s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;}.d01-fcta-primary{background:#0F8A5F;border-color:#0F8A5F;color:#FAF7EC;}.d01-fcta-primary:hover{background:#0A0E15;border-color:#0A0E15;}.d01-fcta-secondary{background:transparent;color:#0A0E15;border-color:rgba(10,14,21,0.20);}.d01-fcta-secondary:hover{border-color:#0A0E15;}@media(max-width:800px){.d01-fcta-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:32px 24px;gap:32px;}.d01-fcta{padding:24px 20px 48px;}}</style><div class=\"d01-fpage\"><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>01</b> · Kelompok kemampuan</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">Manajemen <em>Kode QR.</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">Hal-hal dasar, dikerjakan dengan baik: kode yang dapat diedit, pengalihan cerdas, pembuatan berskala. Cetak sekali, gunakan kembali selamanya.</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">01 · Editable</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Kode QR dinamis</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Perbarui tujuan kapan saja tanpa mencetak ulang. Ubah URL, ganti halaman arahan, luncurkan penawaran baru — kode yang tercetak tidak pernah berubah.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Edit · Version</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">02 · Routing</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Pengalihan cerdas</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Arahkan berdasarkan jenis perangkat, browser, OS, bahasa, atau aturan khusus. Kirim pengguna iOS ke App Store, Android ke Google Play, sisanya ke cadangan.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Device · Rules</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">03 · Bulk</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Pembuatan massal</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Hasilkan ratusan kode unik dari sebuah CSV. Dibuat untuk kemasan produk, kampanye multi-lokasi, dan penerapan berskala acara.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">CSV · At scale</span></article></div></section><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>02</b> · Kelompok kemampuan</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">Kecerdasan <em>lokasi.</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">Geofencing GPS mengubah satu kode menjadi kode yang berbeda di setiap tempat. Tentukan zona, arahkan berdasarkan wilayah, sajikan konten lokal.</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">04 · Geofence</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Geofencing GPS</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Tentukan batas virtual berdasarkan radius atau poligon. Arahkan secara berbeda saat pemindaian terjadi di dalam atau di luar zona, dengan akurasi tingkat meter.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Radius · Polygon</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">05 · Local</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Konten berbasis lokasi</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Tampilkan toko terdekat, harga lokal, penawaran regional, halaman arahan dengan bahasa yang tepat. Kode yang sama, dilokalkan secara langsung.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Personalised</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">06 · Multi</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Perutean multi-lokasi</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Satu kode per waralaba, tanpa beban tambahan. Petakan setiap lokasi pemindai ke tujuan yang tepat secara otomatis; kelola secara terpusat.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Franchise · Chain</span></article></div></section><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>03</b> · Kelompok kemampuan</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">Perutean <em>waktu.</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">Waktu dalam sehari, hari dalam seminggu, tanggal kalender. Perilaku yang berubah sesuai jadwal, tanpa campur tangan manusia.</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">07 · Hours</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Perutean berbasis waktu</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Tujuan berbeda berdasarkan jam, hari, atau rentang tanggal. Menu brunch sebelum pukul 11, makan malam setelah pukul 17, promo khusus pada hari Sabtu.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Hours · Days</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">08 · Live</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Pembaruan instan</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Perubahan menyebar dalam waktu subdetik. Tanpa flush CDN, tanpa rebuild, tanpa menunggu. Luncurkan perubahan, pemindaian berikutnya langsung menerapkannya.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Sub-second</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">09 · Schedule</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Penjadwalan kampanye</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Tetapkan tanggal mulai dan berakhir untuk kode apa pun. Luncurkan kampanye pukul 9 pagi Senin, akhiri tengah malam Minggu — tanpa pertukaran manual.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Auto · Calendar</span></article></div></section><section class=\"d01-fgroup\"><div class=\"d01-fgroup-head\"><span class=\"d01-fgroup-id\"><b>04</b> · Kelompok kemampuan</span><h2 class=\"d01-fgroup-name\">Analitik <em>dan tim.</em></h2><p class=\"d01-fgroup-blurb\">Kecerdasan waktu nyata, kolaborasi dengan cakupan peran, penyajian yang mengutamakan seluler. Operasikan seperti bagian lain dari tumpukan teknologi Anda.</p></div><div class=\"d01-fcards\"><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">10 · Insight</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Analitik lanjutan</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Pelacakan pemindaian waktu nyata dengan kecerdasan lokasi, perangkat, browser, waktu, dan konversi. Peta panas, corong, ekspor, integrasi.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Geo · Funnel · Export</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">11 · Team</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Kolaborasi tim</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Undang rekan tim dengan izin bercakupan peran. Log aktivitas, persetujuan, multi-tenant untuk agensi dan waralaba.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">Roles · Audit</span></article><article class=\"d01-fcard\"><span class=\"d01-fcard-id\">12 · Mobile</span><h3 class=\"d01-fcard-title\">Dioptimalkan untuk seluler</h3><p class=\"d01-fcard-desc\">Deteksi perangkat cerdas, halaman arahan responsif, first paint yang cepat. Bekerja sempurna di iOS, Android, dan lainnya.</p><span class=\"d01-fcard-tag\">iOS · Android</span></article></div></section></div><section class=\"d01-fcta\"><div class=\"d01-fcta-inner\"><div><span class=\"d01-fcta-kicker\">D01 / READY</span><h2 class=\"d01-fcta-headline\">Dua belas fitur. <em>Satu kode yang dapat diedit.</em></h2></div><div class=\"d01-fcta-actions\"><a class=\"d01-fcta-primary\" href=\"https://app.scanfence.com/signup\">Mulai uji coba gratis</a><a class=\"d01-fcta-secondary\" href=\"/contact/\">Bicara dengan tim penjualan</a></div></div></section>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
